  "_source": "Extracted verbatim from pipeline_Q3_BioBERT_5ejes_CORREGIDO.ipynb (Fase 5 cell, topic classification into 5 content axes). Provided here as an externalized, reviewable config artifact; the notebook remains the executable source of truth until fully modularized into src/.",
